    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16298" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσκοπος</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>aimless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					8.86
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phlp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					846.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσκοπα τοξεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tox.</u>
					62
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως, εἰκῇ καὶ ἀ. χρήσασθαι τοῖς
					πράγμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.14.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλανώμενος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					49
