			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λόγους ῥίπτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					4.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				3.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				902.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ. εἰκάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.2.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).768
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.Anecd.</u>
			</span></i>I.</div>
